    <mxCell id="note" value="&lt;b&gt;Exception outcomes (EF-05 … EF-09)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;App will not start → do not substitute a mockup; record [SCREENSHOT REQUIRED: app failed to start — reason] and report the gap to SM.&lt;br&gt;Instance owned by another person/process → report to SM; do not terminate it.&lt;br&gt;Capture tooling unavailable (no emulator, no driver, no OS screenshot path) → record the gap naming the missing capability.&lt;br&gt;Evidence produced from a previous build → delete, re-capture from the verified instance, note the re-capture.&lt;br&gt;Silent omission of a missing screenshot is a hard failure, not a gap." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
